  "citation": "Pennington S; Bond-Lamberty B; Rich R; Peixoto R B; Machado-Silva F; Maier K; Megonigal J P; Phillips E; Regier P; Sandoval L; Stearns A; Ward N; Weintraub M; Wilson S J; Bailey V (2025): COMPASS-FME Synoptic Sites Level 1 Sensor Data v2-0. COMPASS-FME. Dataset. doi:10.15485/2588616",
  "dataset": {
